01:24:15.207 --> 01:24:18.471
Sorry to hear that, uh, Rajib.


01:24:18.472 --> 01:24:21.063
"Run"!


01:24:21.064 --> 01:24:24.647
Run like Seabiscuit, okay?


01:24:24.648 --> 01:24:28.757
